urers.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Twelfth bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Potion of Silence (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Orange)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Orange_a8ad8f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Potion of Silence</td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Gharonk Journal Day 3 (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Brown Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Brown_Square_fc952f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Day three in the Gharonk city.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Thirteenth bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 300px;\">Gharonk Journal Day 5 (Book)</td><td style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 32px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Book (Blue)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Blue_3cfc08.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\">Day 5 in the Gharonk city.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Fourteenth bookcase</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\">Book Type</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Short Description</th></t